            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the PR!\r\n\r\nThis looks like something that is possible for the user to configure on their own: `require('mini.notify').setup({ window = { winblend = vim.env.DISPLAY and 25 or 0 } })`. Together with it not being quite as ubiquitous as needed for this change of default value, I'd say this is not planned.",
